00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.970
Vagan.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:48.730
A new nation created by those abandoned in the Mars Sphere after the failed settlement plan.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.440
Forced to live in this harsh environment,

00:02:54.980 --> 00:03:03.490
